 that have changed need to. Whenever a head disappears (e.g. a monitor is unplugged), a
 wlr_output_head.finished event will be sent. After one or more heads appear, change or
 disappear, the done event will be sent. It carries a serial which can be used in a
 create_configuration request to update heads properties. The information obtained from this
 protocol should only be used for output configuration purposes. This protocol is not
 designed to be a generic output property advertisement protocol for regular clients.
